      <tr><td>Delivery</td><td>Commitments per shared dependency</td><td>Concentration risk on one supplier, carrier or team</td><td>Large correlated failures</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Finance</td><td>Payment success rate by method and route</td><td>Failing payment routes, processor or configuration issues</td><td>Collected revenue, involuntary churn</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Finance</td><td>Billed vs collected gap, aged</td><td>Collections slowing, billing errors, disputes</td><td>Cash flow</td></tr>
